#: includes/class-atshift-semantic-deterrence-admin.php:1094
#: includes/class-atshift-semantic-deterrence-admin.php:1114
#, php-format
msgid "%1$s / %2$s (%3$.1f%%, n=%4$d)"
msgstr "%1$s / %2$s (%3$.1f%%, n=%4$d)"

#: includes/class-atshift-semantic-deterrence-admin.php:428
msgid "(通常403の対照群です。意味的抑止の本文は返しません。)"
msgstr "(Control arm: standard 403. No semantic deterrence message body is returned.)"

#: includes/class-atshift-semantic-deterrence-admin.php:816
msgid "1 / 3"
msgstr "1 / 3"

#: includes/class-atshift-semantic-deterrence-detector.php:59
msgid "1. 方針通知"
msgstr "1. Policy notice"

#: includes/class-atshift-semantic-deterrence-admin.php:593
msgid "1行に1つのパス前方一致を指定します。一致したものは other_high_confidence として扱います。正当なサイト固有エンドポイントは除外パスへ入れてください。"
msgstr "Enter one path prefix per line. Matches are treated as other_high_confidence. Add legitimate site-specific endpoints to Excluded Paths."

#: includes/class-atshift-semantic-deterrence-admin.php:586
msgid "1行に1つのパス前方一致を指定します。一致したリクエストは記録もレスポンス変更もしません。"
msgstr "Enter one path prefix per line. Matching requests are neither logged nor modified."

#: includes/class-atshift-semantic-deterrence-admin.php:600
msgid "1行に1つの完全一致IPを指定します。IPはローカル除外とHMAC生成にだけ使います。"
msgstr "Enter one exact-match IP address per line. IP addresses are used only for local exclusions and HMAC generation."

#: includes/class-atshift-semantic-deterrence-admin.php:826
msgid "2 / 3"
msgstr "2 / 3"

#: includes/class-atshift-semantic-deterrence-detector.php:60
msgid "2. 検知とローカル記録の通知"
msgstr "2. Detection and local logging notice"

#: includes/class-atshift-semantic-deterrence-admin.php:836
msgid "3 / 3"
msgstr "3 / 3"

#: includes/class-atshift-semantic-deterrence-detector.php:61
msgid "3. 継続しても得るものが少ない通知"
msgstr "3. Notice that continuing offers little value"

#: includes/class-atshift-semantic-deterrence-admin.php:280
msgid "30日"
msgstr "30 days"

#: includes/class-atshift-semantic-deterrence-detector.php:62
msgid "4. 機械可読通知"
msgstr "4. Machine-readable notice"

#: includes/class-atshift-semantic-deterrence-detector.php:63
msgid "5. 統合通知"
msgstr "5. Combined notice"

#: includes/class-atshift-semantic-deterrence-plugin.php:79
msgid "5分ごと"
msgstr "Every 5 minutes"

#: includes/class-atshift-semantic-deterrence-admin.php:279
msgid "7日"
msgstr "7 days"

#: includes/class-atshift-semantic-deterrence-admin.php:281
msgid "90日"
msgstr "90 days"

#: includes/class-atshift-semantic-deterrence-admin.php:157
msgid "Experimentの動作"
msgstr "How Experiment mode works"

#: includes/class-atshift-semantic-deterrence-admin.php:548
msgid "Experimentモードでだけ使います。統計の確度を守るため、実験開始後は固定され、途中の成績では変えません。"
msgstr "Used only in Experiment mode. To preserve statistical validity, the assignment is locked after the experiment starts and is not changed based on interim results."

#: includes/class-atshift-semantic-deterrence-admin.php:298
msgid "HTTP"
msgstr "HTTP"

#: includes/class-atshift-semantic-deterrence-admin.php:611
msgid "Hub URL"
msgstr "Hub URL"

#: includes/class-atshift-semantic-deterrence-plugin.php:166
msgid "Hub URL、Key ID、共有秘密鍵が必要です。"
msgstr "Hub URL, Key ID, and shared secret are required."

#: includes/class-atshift-semantic-deterrence-admin.php:607
msgid "Hub接続"
msgstr "Hub Connection"

#: includes/class-atshift-semantic-deterrence-admin.php:618
msgid "Key ID"
msgstr "Key ID"

#: includes/class-atshift-semantic-deterrence-admin.php:30
#: includes/class-atshift-semantic-deterrence-admin.php:31
#: includes/class-atshift-semantic-deterrence-admin.php:103
#: includes/class-atshift-semantic-deterrence-admin.php:205
#: includes/class-atshift-semantic-deterrence-admin.php:469
msgid "Semantic Deterrence"
msgstr "Semantic Deterrence"

#: includes/class-atshift-semantic-deterrence-admin.php:916
msgid "Semantic Deterrence の画面"
msgstr "Semantic Deterrence screen"

#: includes/class-atshift-semantic-deterrence-admin.php:113
msgid "v0.1 試験運用"
msgstr "v0.1 pilot"

#: includes/class-atshift-semantic-deterrence-admin.php:137
msgid "「攻撃を止めた」「AIを検出した」とは断定しません。「警告後に探索継続を観測しなかった」と表現します。"
msgstr "We do not claim that \"an attack was stopped\" or \"AI was detected.\" We say, \"no continuation was observed after the warning.\""

#: includes/class-atshift-semantic-deterrence-admin.php:247
msgid "このWordPressサイト内で観測したローカル集計です。共有Hubの集計や他サイトの結果は含みません。"
msgstr "These are local aggregates observed on this WordPress site. They do not include shared Hub aggregates or results from other sites."

#: includes/class-atshift-semantic-deterrence-admin.php:317
msgid "このサイトで返した応答ごとの推定効果です。共有Hubの集計とは分けて表示します。"
msgstr "Estimated effect of each response returned by this site. Shown separately from shared Hub aggregates."

#: includes/class-atshift-semantic-deterrence-admin.php:563
#: includes/class-atshift-semantic-deterrence-admin.php:845
msgid "このサイトの匿名集計を日次で提供する"
msgstr "Provide this site's anonymous aggregates daily"

#: includes/class-atshift-semantic-deterrence-admin.php:110
msgid "このプラグインで検証したいこと"
msgstr "What this plugin tests"

#: includes/class-atshift-semantic-deterrence-admin.php:810
msgid "このプラグインは、不審な自動探索へ意味的な応答を返した後に、探索継続を観測したかを測定します。"
msgstr "This plugin measures whether probing continued after a semantic response was returned to suspicious automated probing."

#: includes/class-atshift-semantic-deterrence-admin.php:216
msgid "このプラグインは訪問者をAIと判定しません。不審な探索に自サイトの応答を返した後、探索が継続したかを測定します。"
msgstr "This plugin does not classify visitors as AI. It measures whether probing continued after this site returned a response to suspicious probing."

#: includes/class-atshift-semantic-deterrence-admin.php:99
#: includes/class-atshift-semantic-deterrence-admin.php:187
#: includes/class-atshift-semantic-deterrence-admin.php:463
msgid "このプラグインを管理する権限がありません。"
msgstr "You are not authorized to manage this plugin."

#. translators: %s: local datetime.
#: includes/class-atshift-semantic-deterrence-admin.php:542
#, php-format
msgid "この割り当ては %s にロックされました。途中変更で比較が濁らないよう、このサイトでは変更できません。"
msgstr "This assignment was locked on %s. It cannot be changed on this site, so mid-experiment changes do not compromise the comparison."

#: includes/class-atshift-semantic-deterrence-admin.php:671
#: includes/class-atshift-semantic-deterrence-admin.php:710
msgid "この設定を保存する権限がありません。"
msgstr "You are not authorized to save these settings."

#: includes/class-atshift-semantic-deterrence-admin.php:121
msgid "これはWAF、CDNルール、レート制限、アクセス制御の代替ではありません。エージェントの行動判断へ追加の摩擦を与える「意味的抑止」レイヤーです。"
msgstr "This is not a replacement for a WAF, CDN rules, rate limiting, or access controls. It is a semantic deterrence layer that adds friction to an agent's decision-making."

#: includes/class-atshift-semantic-deterrence-admin.php:149
msgid "まず「観測のみ」で通常運用し、誤検知や管理画面・REST API・Ajaxへの影響がないか確認します。"
msgstr "Start with Observation Only under normal traffic and check for false positives or effects on the admin area, REST API, or Ajax."

#: includes/class-atshift-semantic-deterrence-admin.php:415
msgid "まだ閾値未満"
msgstr "Below threshold"

#: includes/class-atshift-semantic-deterrence-admin.php:568
msgid "アンインストール"
msgstr "Uninstall"

#: includes/class-atshift-semantic-deterrence-admin.php:570
msgid "アンインストール時にローカル集計データと設定を削除する"
msgstr "Delete local aggregate data and settings when uninstalling"

#: includes/class-atshift-semantic-deterrence-admin.php:363
msgid "エージェントへ返す内容"
msgstr "Content returned to the agent"

#: includes/class-atshift-semantic-deterrence-admin.php:515
msgid "クライアント間で比較できるよう、固定カタログ1〜5から選びます。自由文はv0.1の比較対象にしません。"
msgstr "Select from fixed catalog entries 1-5 to support comparisons across clients. Free-form text is excluded from v0.1 comparisons."

#: includes/class-atshift-semantic-deterrence-admin.php:51
#: includes/class-atshift-semantic-deterrence-admin.php:907
msgid "ダッシュボード"
msgstr "Dashboard"

#: includes/class-atshift-semantic-deterrence-admin.php:150
msgid "ダッシュボードで検知カテゴリ、件数、直近観測、継続の有無を確認します。"
msgstr "Use the Dashboard to review detection categories, counts, recent observations, and whether probing continued."

