msgstr "Around %1$s local time, distributed across a %2$d-hour jitter window."

#: includes/class-atshift-semantic-deterrence-admin.php:772
msgid "ローカル集計データをエクスポートする権限がありません。"
msgstr "You are not authorized to export local aggregate data."

#: includes/class-atshift-semantic-deterrence-admin.php:657
msgid "ローカル集計データを削除"
msgstr "Delete Local Aggregate Data"

#: includes/class-atshift-semantic-deterrence-admin.php:893
msgid "ローカル集計データを削除し、観測のみへ戻しました。実験割り当ては再度選択できます。"
msgstr "Local aggregate data was deleted and the mode was reset to Observation Only. You can select the experiment assignment again."

#: includes/class-atshift-semantic-deterrence-admin.php:1014
msgid "一時制限"
msgstr "Temporary Limit"

#: includes/class-atshift-semantic-deterrence-admin.php:553
msgid "一時制限秒数"
msgstr "Temporary limit duration in seconds"

#: includes/class-atshift-semantic-deterrence-admin.php:250
msgid "不審な探索を検知"
msgstr "Suspicious probing detected"

#: includes/class-atshift-semantic-deterrence-admin.php:111
msgid "不審な自動探索に対して、通常のHTTP拒否だけでなく、機械可読な状態と自然言語の撤退勧告を返したとき、その後の探索継続が減るかを観測します。"
msgstr "We observe whether subsequent probing decreases when suspicious automated probing receives a machine-readable status and a natural-language recommendation to disengage in addition to a standard HTTP denial."

#: includes/class-atshift-semantic-deterrence-admin.php:273
#: includes/class-atshift-semantic-deterrence-admin.php:327
msgid "不明"
msgstr "Unknown"

#: includes/class-atshift-semantic-deterrence-admin.php:176
msgid "中央からは命令しない"
msgstr "No central commands"

#: includes/class-atshift-semantic-deterrence-admin.php:278
msgid "今日"
msgstr "Today"

#: includes/class-atshift-semantic-deterrence-admin.php:289
msgid "他のセキュリティ通知と時刻や分類を見比べるためのローカル観測です。このプラグインはWAFログを読みません。IP、URL、User-Agent、Cookie、リクエスト本文は保存していません。"
msgstr "These local observations let you compare timestamps and classifications with other security alerts. This plugin does not read WAF logs or store IP addresses, URLs, User-Agent strings, cookies, or request bodies."

#: includes/class-atshift-semantic-deterrence-admin.php:324
msgid "件数"
msgstr "Count"

#. translators: %s: Plugin author.
#: includes/class-atshift-semantic-deterrence-plugin.php:404
#, php-format
msgid "作者: %s"
msgstr "Author: %s"

#: includes/class-atshift-semantic-deterrence-admin.php:625
msgid "保存後は表示しません。匿名集計POSTのHMAC署名にだけ使います。"
msgstr "Not shown after saving. Used only to sign anonymous aggregate POST requests with HMAC."

#: includes/class-atshift-semantic-deterrence-admin.php:624
msgid "保存済み。変更時だけ入力"
msgstr "Saved. Enter only to change"

#: includes/class-atshift-semantic-deterrence-admin.php:140
