msgstr "About sharing"

#: includes/class-atshift-semantic-deterrence-admin.php:622
msgid "共有秘密鍵"
msgstr "Shared secret"

#: includes/class-atshift-semantic-deterrence-admin.php:414
msgid "共有集計で高く見える応答"
msgstr "Response with the highest shared aggregate estimate"

#: includes/class-atshift-semantic-deterrence-admin.php:396
msgid "共有集計の参照"
msgstr "View Shared Aggregates"

#: includes/class-atshift-semantic-deterrence-admin.php:323
msgid "内容識別"
msgstr "Content ID"

#: includes/class-atshift-semantic-deterrence-admin.php:294
msgid "分類"
msgstr "Category"

#: includes/class-atshift-semantic-deterrence-admin.php:896
msgid "初回確認を完了しました。設定はいつでも変更できます。"
msgstr "Initial review completed. You can change the settings at any time."

#: includes/class-atshift-semantic-deterrence-admin.php:128
msgid "初期状態"
msgstr "Initial state"

#: includes/class-atshift-semantic-deterrence-admin.php:817
msgid "初期状態は観測のみ"
msgstr "Starts in Observation Only"

#: includes/class-atshift-semantic-deterrence-admin.php:129
msgid "初期設定は「観測のみ」です。プラグインを有効化しただけでは、HTTPレスポンスを変更しません。"
msgstr "The initial setting is Observation Only. Activating the plugin alone does not modify HTTP responses."

#: includes/class-atshift-semantic-deterrence-admin.php:254
#: includes/class-atshift-semantic-deterrence-admin.php:1013
msgid "判定不能"
msgstr "Indeterminate"

#: includes/class-atshift-semantic-deterrence-admin.php:1011
msgid "別分類で継続"
msgstr "Continued under another category"

#: includes/class-atshift-semantic-deterrence-admin.php:141
msgid "匿名共有は明示的なオプトイン後だけ行います。IP、URL、Cookie、本文、ドメインを含まない匿名集計だけを扱います。"
msgstr "Anonymous sharing occurs only after explicit opt-in. Only anonymous aggregates without IP addresses, URLs, cookies, request bodies, or domains are handled."

#: includes/class-atshift-semantic-deterrence-admin.php:662
msgid "匿名集計JSONをダウンロード"
msgstr "Download Anonymous Aggregate JSON"

#: includes/class-atshift-semantic-deterrence-admin.php:821
msgid "匿名集計の参照を有効にする"
msgstr "Enable viewing anonymous aggregates"

#: includes/class-atshift-semantic-deterrence-admin.php:228
msgid "匿名集計の提供はオプトイン時だけ日次ジッターで送信します。集計参照は提供に参加しなくても利用できます。"
msgstr "Anonymous aggregates are sent daily with jitter only after opt-in. You can view aggregates without contributing data."

#: includes/class-atshift-semantic-deterrence-admin.php:812
msgid "参加しなくても、自分のサイトの状況確認と、集まった匿名集計データの参照は可能です。"
msgstr "Without participating, you can still review your site's status and view the collected anonymous aggregate data."

#: includes/class-atshift-semantic-deterrence-admin.php:564
msgid "参加しなくても集計の参照は可能です。提供する場合も、IP、URL、Cookie、本文、ドメインは送信しません。"
msgstr "You can view aggregates without participating. Even when contributing, no IP addresses, URLs, cookies, request bodies, or domains are sent."

#: includes/class-atshift-semantic-deterrence-admin.php:399
msgid "参照停止中"
msgstr "Viewing disabled"

#: includes/class-atshift-semantic-deterrence-admin.php:399
msgid "参照有効"
msgstr "Viewing enabled"

#: includes/class-atshift-semantic-deterrence-admin.php:562
msgid "各クライアントが共有した匿名集計を参照する"
msgstr "View anonymous aggregates shared by clients"

#: includes/class-atshift-semantic-deterrence-admin.php:397
msgid "各クライアントが提供した匿名集計を読み出します。中央からコード、強制遮断、強制設定は受け取りません。"
msgstr "Retrieves anonymous aggregates contributed by clients. No code, forced blocking, or forced settings are received from the central service."

#: includes/class-atshift-semantic-deterrence-admin.php:165
msgid "同じ探索元らしきローカル系列には同じ応答を返します。途中で文面が変わって測定が濁るのを避けます。"
msgstr "The same response is returned to a local sequence that appears to come from the same probing source. This prevents mid-sequence wording changes from compromising the measurement."

#: includes/class-atshift-semantic-deterrence-admin.php:264
msgid "同じ自サイト内の観測を期間ごとに見ています。"
msgstr "Compares observations from this site across time periods."

#: includes/class-atshift-semantic-deterrence-admin.php:152
msgid "問題がなければ、明示的にDeterrenceまたはExperimentへ切り替えて効果測定を始めます。"
msgstr "If no issues are found, explicitly switch to Deterrence or Experiment to begin measuring the effect."

#: includes/class-atshift-semantic-deterrence-admin.php:160
msgid "固定カタログで比較"
msgstr "Compare using a fixed catalog"

#: includes/class-atshift-semantic-deterrence-admin.php:1142
msgid "固定表示"
msgstr "Fixed display"

#: includes/class-atshift-semantic-deterrence-admin.php:1134
msgid "固定表示と段階表示を混ぜる"
msgstr "Mix fixed and staged displays"

#: includes/class-atshift-semantic-deterrence-admin.php:1133
msgid "固定表示のみ"
msgstr "Fixed display only"

#: includes/class-atshift-semantic-deterrence-admin.php:838
msgid "実験では自サイトの高確度な不審探索に応答しながら、通常403の対照群と5種類の固定応答を決め打ちで割り当てます。匿名提供ではIP、URL、Cookie、本文、ドメインを送りません。"
msgstr "In the experiment, this site deters high-confidence suspicious probing while assigning a standard 403 control arm or one of five fixed responses. Anonymous contributions do not send IP addresses, URLs, cookies, request bodies, or domains."

#: includes/class-atshift-semantic-deterrence-admin.php:519
msgid "実験への参加"
msgstr "Experiment Participation"

#: includes/class-atshift-semantic-deterrence-admin.php:368
msgid "実験モードでは、設定した割り当て戦略に従い、固定カタログと通常403の対照群を決め打ちで割り当てます。途中の成績で自動変更しません。"
msgstr "In Experiment mode, the fixed catalog and standard 403 control arm are assigned according to the configured assignment strategy. Assignments do not change automatically based on interim results."

#: includes/class-atshift-semantic-deterrence-admin.php:526
msgid "実験割り当て"
msgstr "Experiment Assignment"

#: includes/class-atshift-semantic-deterrence-admin.php:493
msgid "実験参加: 自サイトでは高確度の不審探索へ意味的応答を返しながら、固定カタログと通常403の対照群を使って測定します。同意した場合だけ匿名集計を共有し、様々なサイトでの結果を比較できるようにします。"
msgstr "Experiment participation: Deter high-confidence suspicious probing on this site while measuring fixed catalog responses against a standard 403 control arm. Anonymous aggregates are shared only with your consent, enabling comparisons across different sites."

#: includes/class-atshift-semantic-deterrence-admin.php:809
msgid "実験参加と集計参照"
msgstr "Experiment Participation and Aggregate Viewing"

#: includes/class-atshift-semantic-deterrence-admin.php:522
msgid "実験参加モードを選んでも、このチェックを入れるまではHTTPレスポンスを変更しません。"
msgstr "Selecting Experiment Participation mode does not modify HTTP responses until you select this checkbox."

#: includes/class-atshift-semantic-deterrence-admin.php:296
#: includes/class-atshift-semantic-deterrence-admin.php:322
msgid "実験群"
msgstr "Experiment arm"

#: includes/class-atshift-semantic-deterrence-admin.php:430
#: includes/class-atshift-semantic-deterrence-admin.php:1162
msgid "対照群: 通常403"
msgstr "Control arm: standard 403"

#: includes/class-atshift-semantic-deterrence-admin.php:172
msgid "対照群との差を見る"
msgstr "Compare with the control arm"

#: includes/class-atshift-semantic-deterrence-admin.php:231
msgid "将来の日次共有予定:"
msgstr "Future daily sharing scheduled:"

#: includes/class-atshift-semantic-deterrence-admin.php:177
msgid "将来の集計読み出しは判断材料の取得に限ります。中央からコード、強制遮断、強制設定は受け取りません。"
msgstr "Future aggregate retrieval is limited to information for decision-making. No code, forced blocking, or forced settings are received from the central service."

#: includes/class-atshift-semantic-deterrence-admin.php:1012
msgid "強い探索へ変化"
msgstr "Shifted to more aggressive probing"

#: includes/class-atshift-semantic-deterrence-admin.php:503
msgid "強め"
msgstr "Aggressive"

#: includes/class-atshift-semantic-deterrence-admin.php:297
msgid "応答"
msgstr "Response"

#: includes/class-atshift-semantic-deterrence-admin.php:827
msgid "応答変更は明示的に選ぶ"
msgstr "Response changes require explicit selection"

#: includes/class-atshift-semantic-deterrence-admin.php:333
msgid "応答比較データはまだありません。"
